<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花悲しい.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I do not know... 
{PAUSE ""}
Nothing... 
{PAUSE ""}
I do not know anything...!
{PAUSE ""}
　I truly do not know!<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
I was restrained immediately after that. 
{PAUSE ""}
After I registered Natsumi's death, I came back to myself and understood, for the first time, what had happened.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
No... I suppose I could not understand it fully. 
{PAUSE ""}
What I remember is being unable to accept what I had done, unable to accept that Natsumi had died...<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
I simply stared blankly into the air, thinking, 'What a bad dream this is. I've got to wake up, fast.'<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花悲しい.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Because...
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花怒り.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Because it is impossible, is it not...!
{PAUSE ""}
　Me, killing Natsumi...!<PG>
